Changes made to the BFCL material:
  - 24 tasks were selected from the multi-turn base and composite splits
    (BFCL_v3_multi_turn_base.json, BFCL_v3_multi_turn_composite.json) and
    stored with new task IDs (T001-T024); the list of environment classes
    of each task is stored sorted.
  - reference_states.json holds the environment states obtained by
    executing each task's ground-truth calls with the BFCL environment code.
  - The trajectories record language-model agents working on these tasks
    through a fault-injection layer; some tool results in them were
    deliberately altered (timeouts, removed tools, rejected arguments, and
    corrupted values) as part of the study.

The BFCL environment code itself is not redistributed. It is fetched at the
commit above into third_party/ when needed.
